  promises "The genuine continuum Liouville carrier L2(X times X) now supports explicit bounded-generator exponential C0 semigroups, bounded reservoir sandwiches, right strong generator identification, operator-norm approximation stability, Mathlib weak-operator convergence, and fixed-factor WOT sandwich continuity. Densely-defined closable continuum generators also receive their canonical densely-defined closed extension. The boundary is explicit: the file does not infer complete positivity, trace preservation, density-operator positivity, or unbounded semigroup generation without separate model and Hille-Yosida data."
  at_level bridge_theorem
  contract_status satisfied
  requires_objects ["lean:QuantumMechanics.LiouvilleSecondQuantization.ContinuumKernelSpace",
    "lean:NormedSpace.exp",
    "lean:ContinuousLinearMapWOT.tendsto_iff_forall_inner_apply_tendsto",
    "lean:LinearPMap.IsClosable.closure_isClosed"]
  forbids_substitutes ["a finite matrix space relabeled as an infinite Hilbert-Schmidt carrier",
    "claiming WOT multiplication is jointly continuous",
